verses:
The foxes have a hole, and the birds have a nest,
The Son of Man he dwell in the sky;
Jehovah, hallelujah! The Lord is a-provide;
Jehovah, hallelujah! The Lord is a-provide.

I do believe, without a doubt,
That the Christian has a right to shout;
Jehovah, hallelujah! The Lord is a-provide;
Jehovah, hallelujah! The Lord is a-provide.

What make old Satan follow me so?
Satan got nothing at all to do with me;
Hold your light on Canaan's shore.

O graveyard, O graveyard,
I'm walking through the graveyard;
Lay this body down.

The tallest tree in Paradise,
The Christian calls the tree of life;
Turn, sinner, turn O!

O sinner, you make a mistake,
While Jesus is calling, you harden your heart;
Turn, sinner, turn O!
